	Find a room with a fountain or sink.  Best is a room on an 
upper level (= smaller monsters) with lockable doors (= no party
crashers).  If the level has boulders, use them to barricade open
doorways.

	Clear all valuable objects and creatures out of the room.
Stand at the water source and pickax down.  You'll usually end up
with pools of water scattered around the room.

	Lock or block the doors.

	Strip off and drop all rustable items.  If you have a luck-
stone, drop it, too.  Jump into a pool until all your junk items are
blanked.

